 "desk_sentence": "4.45 pp 的行情段通道有入场时可读的读者。；trail_vol60 ρ=-0.05（置换 p=0.88，全样本多 +0.77 pp/季，前半定方向→后半 -0.90 pp/季）；trail_ret60 ρ=+0.50（置换 p=0.08，全样本多 +1.46 pp/季，前半定方向→后半 +0.61 pp/季）；trail_dd60 ρ=-0.67（置换 p=0.02，全样本多 -1.05 pp/季，前半定方向→后半 +1.65 pp/季）；xs_disp60 ρ=-0.02（置换 p=0.94，全样本多 +0.14 pp/季，前半定方向→后半 -0.47 pp/季）；trail_vol20 ρ=-0.37（置换 p=0.21，全样本多 +0.02 pp/季，前半定方向→后半 +0.66 pp/季）；own_prev_q ρ=+0.01（置换 p=0.99，全样本多 +1.38 pp/季，前半定方向→后半 n/a）；同时试 5 个观察量，族级置换 p=0.080（单个观察量的 p 不算数），样本 13 个季度，快节奏在 54% 的季度里赢，换成完美先知也只有 2.50 pp/季",
 "honest": [
  "the column effect is a median polish property of the segment, not a trade; it prices the quarter, it does not fill an order",
  "n_segments is the whole sample: 13 readable segments is a small-sample read, and the permutation p is the only defence offered against that",
  "observables are measured on the equal-weight book universe; a different universe would give different vol/dispersion numbers on the same dates",
  "own_prev_q is the previous readable segment's effect, so the first readable segment cannot be scored and overlapping quarters are not modelled"
 ]
}
